;
; How Footlight files one slide of a deck in MYRA (footlight_rules.h FL7):
; under the deck's number and the slide's place in it, the seconds it was
; rehearsed for, its layout (0 title, 1 title and text, 2 text only, 3
; blank), the bytes of its text and when it was last changed (ms since
; 1970). The rules say what the values may mean; this says whether they
; make a record.
^ZXFOOTLIGHT(deck:i9, slide:i4) = secs:i4! ^ layout:i1! ^ bytes:i7! ^ stamp:i15!
